# The exported demo operator is a build artifact of a checkpoint, not a source. It is
# several MiB and is re-exported whenever a better model is trained, so tracking it would
# bake every superseded copy into history. Regenerate with:
#   uv run qft-operator-export --checkpoint <run>/checkpoints/best.ckpt \
#       --output frontend/public/operator
# The page degrades gracefully without it and says so in the header.
frontend/public/operator/
